# Leader, Super-Genius: the replacement applies to any connive of a creature Bot1 controls, not only Leader's own trigger. Turn 1 Bot1
# casts Leader with Black Lotus and Mox Sapphire; at the beginning of combat Leader connives (draws Plains then Savannah Lions,
# discards Plains). On turn 3 Bolt kills Bot2's Llanowar Elves, so Spymaster's Vault's "Target creature you control connives X"
# is connive 1 (X = 1 creature died): Bot1 draws Runeclaw Bear (the replacement), then connive draws Forest, and discards Savannah
# Lions - three cards in and one out - a +1/+1 counter, as a nonland card was discarded.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Black Lotus
Leader, Super-Genius
Spymaster's Vault
Lightning Bolt
Plains
Savannah Lions
Hill Giant
Runeclaw Bear
Forest
Plains x9

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Llanowar Elves
Forest x18

